{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y对人物动机和最终心理转变有所压缩，尤其省略了即使等不到新的亲近关系，也愿意独自好好生活这一层重要的结局；X交代得更完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词让观众迅速抓住每段叙事重心，感受词又能随音乐分时出现，减少同时面对一大堆文字的负担；音乐中的音色、节奏、力度、身体感受也对应得更细，听觉与文字更容易形成联系。X的优势是人物心理因果交代得更充分，尤其后半段为什么不回头、如何接受孤独、最终怎样安顿自己，叙事闭合得更完整。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但它确实以部分人物心理的完整性换来了更好的扫读体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9da4b22c-b36d-4883-986e-4235784e4cc7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T220742523264Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.843, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:08:20.393483+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ba0c4a84310292165f5b22aa68a6f58ba2c9102faa98c5b70fdb9ebe1b52058", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp